{"ID":"20240522082240-gea5mz5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082240-gea5mz5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082240-gea5mz5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095843-dcg63jo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095902-n126fgh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522095859-caxey1t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"刘菲菲医师的心脏病医案报告","type":"doc","updated":"20240522095934"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-dcg63jo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-dcg63jo","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刘菲菲医师的心脏病医案报告"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-v7kl3t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-v7kl3t9","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2009年10月22号 初诊"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-5xa7yf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-5xa7yf8","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美国人，女 ，69 岁，中胖"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-7ypaj8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-7ypaj8i","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸闷，心痛好几个月了，感觉自己不平衡，觉得呼吸困难，膝盖痛，易骨折，骨质疏松症，反酸，胃胀气，膀胱下垂。鼻炎多年，2009年6月手术治疗后，也未见明显疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-fekkw19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-fekkw19","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问：心痛是否从胸前穿透到胸后，再从胸后穿透过胸前，回答是的，已经好几个月了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-g29p0dr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-g29p0dr","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-a3zpjpl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-a3zpjpl","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-4f23dkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-4f23dkc","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡不好，每晚夜尿5次"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-0386kui","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-0386kui","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-9tw5v99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-9tw5v99","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口好"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-vt6gym6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-vt6gym6","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-on1cf0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-on1cf0t","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双足冷， 手脚麻木"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-y0tmhbn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-y0tmhbn","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-r2jvois","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-r2jvois","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便 每日行，每日一次"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-w5siwp6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-w5siwp6","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-jtwy5ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-jtwy5ry","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴有，喜冷饮"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-jekc7l2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-jekc7l2","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-jhvcf03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-jhvcf03","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便每日20次，"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-6q70mlh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-6q70mlh","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-lhywg82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-lhywg82","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出汗有"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-s4rx8th","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-s4rx8th","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-qwpgvaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-qwpgvaz","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上半身热，下半身冷"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-0tsfl2a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OS4=","Num":9},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-0tsfl2a","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-hl5fabl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-hl5fabl","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体力差"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-e20mz5b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MTAu","Num":10},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-e20mz5b","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095843-gzb00e5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-gzb00e5","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呼吸时，吸气比吐气困难。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-xu3bokw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-xu3bokw","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌诊：厚黄湿"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-f2roy7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-f2roy7g","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳诊：心区动脉血管阻塞，心区强阳性反应"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-sos8yfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-sos8yfg","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼诊：肾阳不足，心包积痰，肝积毒素"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-yo7r0og","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-yo7r0og","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉诊：缓无力"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-q0a8xjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-q0a8xjj","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"望诊：面部色黑，特别是嘴巴周围色更黑。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-869s9hl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-869s9hl","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针：关元，公孙，巨阙，内关，膝五针等。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-gs2hnks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-gs2hnks","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针完后，病人感觉胸口松了很多，压力减轻许多。嘱：每隔日来针。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-uwxvyo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-uwxvyo0","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方如下："}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-u90vp28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-u90vp28","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"XX四钱，XX五钱，桂枝四钱，厚朴四钱，XXX四钱，细辛二钱，乌药五钱，黄莲二钱，黄芩三钱，炮附子三钱，补骨脂三钱，泽泻三钱，黄芪三钱。 5 付"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-m2qjil6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-m2qjil6","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮成三碗，早晚餐前各一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-2znyae9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-2znyae9","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10月28日"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-bc9cg80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-bc9cg80","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心痛澈背，背痛澈心40%好转，感觉胸中有痰，但减少了许多，胸腔压力减少了，手脚无麻木了，体重掉了5 磅。膝盖好转许多。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-tg17li1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-tg17li1","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针同前方"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-6tv1syt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-6tv1syt","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-miyzfop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-miyzfop","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10月30日"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-ph5kyx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-ph5kyx8","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心痛澈背，背痛澈心好转许多，治疗前是每天都有，现在是偶尔才有一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-zemas0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-zemas0d","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问：睡好很多，夜尿一次。胸部压力感觉50%减轻了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095843-xf3qvnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095843-xf3qvnh","updated":"20240522095843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针同前方。嘱：每隔日来针。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095851-vfq898t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095851-vfq898t","updated":"20240522095851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方"}]},{"ID":"20240522095851-utm8ulv","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095851-utm8ulv","updated":"20240522095851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095851-ccp9wtr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095851-ccp9wtr","updated":"20240522095851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095851-ea3pomk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095851-ea3pomk","updated":"20240522095851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同 10月22号方去炮附子，加巴戟天三钱"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095851-drhxxo9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522095851-drhxxo9","updated":"20240522095851"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522095851-aiaa7fx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095851-aiaa7fx","updated":"20240522095851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汉唐32号（乌金丸） 30 丸每次，早晚餐后各一次。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522095852-hjphds9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095852-hjphds9"}},{"ID":"20240522095859-d69f4dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-d69f4dm","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11月4号来诊"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-pncdem2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-pncdem2","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11月3号早上有呕吐出黑色的痰，拉黑色的大便，量极多，味臭，自从昨天上吐下泻后，今日仍有些胸痛，但不会心痛澈背，背痛澈心了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-1eup3r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-1eup3r0","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我问此病人，你害不害怕？她说不怕，她知道自己在排毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-qgzrb9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-qgzrb9n","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11 月6日来诊"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-t4bhoi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-t4bhoi0","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍有痰咳出，易咳，色时黄，时白，粘稠，有时呕吐出痰，自己感觉胸腔80%的痰去了，胸痛仍有，但只在胸前，不会从胸前痛到胸后了，鼻炎，前几天腰痛厉害，自己偷服了一粒止痛药（因为此人住得比较远，无法开车来针）三日无大便了。夜尿有时3次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-60mz9o8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-60mz9o8","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方如下："}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-h2ntk3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-h2ntk3v","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"XX四钱，XX五钱，桂枝四钱，厚朴四钱，XXX四钱，细辛二钱，乌药五钱，辛夷三钱，石菖蒲三钱，苍术三钱，大黄三钱。     2 付"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-2mr2a7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-2mr2a7c","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮成三碗，早晚餐前各一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-hfnv37d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-hfnv37d","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11月9号来诊"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-0z537qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-0z537qk","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸痛偶尔有，鼻炎好转许多了，腰痛厉害，我一追问，此人服用钙片和多种维生素20余年。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-4w45xg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-4w45xg9","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳诊：肾区强阳性反应，右肾强阳性大于左肾"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-wtkvsim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-wtkvsim","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体诊：左右肾石点阳性反应，右肾石点强阳性大于左肾石点，额凉手温。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-3onc26n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-3onc26n","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诊断：左右肾结石，右肾大于左肾。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-cryukcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-cryukcn","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人现在仍在服药，一是排肾结石，二是虽胸痛几乎去了，但还没有達到“倪式健康六准则”，故不能停药。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-3ueebrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-3ueebrj","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此时，我告诉她，你现在虽然胸痛几乎没有了，你现在不用担心你会发心脏病了，但还不能停药，我现在帮你继续治疗，顺便加上排肾结石的药。她说：“菲菲，我早就不担心了。”此时，我才知道，她先生前几年洗肾，后来过世了，她多我说，她先生过世以后，她自己要求签了一份文件，她宁愿自然病死，无论什么情况出现，她都拒绝洗肾。她经朋友介绍来看我前，看了6个月的心脏专科医生，每次检查，西医都告诉她没问题。她对我说：“我知道自己有问题，我也去别的中医师那里看过，我告诉他们我胸痛，可能是上半背痛牵扯到心痛的，还有膝痛，前后也是每隔天针一次，每周三次，总共22次，我也有按时吃他们给我的中药，可是为什么他们没有想到我的胸痛是心脏的问题引起的呢，为什么他们也帮我治膝盖，但是效果不明显呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-319b9di","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-319b9di","updated":"20240522095934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我不知该如何回答她，此时无声胜有声。我庆幸她没有一味的相信西医，我想起倪師的话： “"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"聪明的人从别人身上学到教训。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”我想这是她坚持继续寻找中医治疗的原因吧。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-xoghoqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-xoghoqu","updated":"20240522095907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生菲菲报告完毕2009年11月10日"}]},{"ID":"20240522095906-kebgy09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095906-kebgy09"}},{"ID":"20240522095859-pxs78jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-pxs78jz","updated":"20240522095927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-caxey1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-caxey1t","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   菲菲是我多位優秀學生之一，讀者現在看到她治療心臟病是輕而易舉的，效果為什麼會這樣好呢？答案只有一個，就是她學到了正確的醫學，就是經方學。處方中她使用的烏金丸是從金匱中的烏頭赤石脂丸改變來的丸劑，現在大部分的中醫師早就不會使用經方，當然更不會知道這烏金丸的出處，案例中的這位病人非常有智慧，她從她先生身上學到教訓，所以不再犯第二過，但是她還是被西藥廠欺騙而持續的服用鈣片與綜合維他命，她服用這些所謂營養劑的後果就是得到骨質疏鬆症與腎結石，所以她會出現膝蓋痛與腰痛，真是花錢買病痛，這類情形我已經不知道看過多少，真是讓人氣憤。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-z6mkms0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-z6mkms0","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    使用經方來治療心臟病是輕而易舉的，我從臨床至今，從未失過手無一不愈，菲菲同學的藥方沒有問題，針灸的穴位老師需要做些補充，當病人出現心痛徹背，背痛徹心的症狀時，除了妳下的穴道之外，可以增加天突穴與關元穴，這二個穴道與巨闕穴合為天、人、地三皇穴，針後讓病人趴著，然後再針第十椎下，這種針法在下完針後，病人的胸痛當場就會去掉至少80%以上，時常會出現胸痛全去的立竿見影的效果，妳沒有這樣針病人，這就是病人再次來診時，只有40%的效果的原因所在。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-nvzcrhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-nvzcrhy","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     老師將處方部份隱去，其目的是要顯示妳使用桂枝的恰當處，讀者要知道一點，現今許多的中醫師一聽到桂枝麻黃等藥時，就頭皮發麻，嚇到手腳酸軟，根本就不敢使用桂枝與麻黃，這是中醫師的悲劇，這就是這位病人來找菲菲治療之前遇到的中醫師，就是這類不敢使用桂枝的溫病派中醫師了，這類中醫師是中醫發展的絆腳石，他們不是正統中醫師，卻打著中醫的名號在治病，想想病人真是可憐，遇到這些庸醫們浪費金錢不說，還耽誤到病情，實在是很丟臉又不道德的一群中醫絆腳石。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-ugwsi0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-ugwsi0c","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     近日來台灣有一位電視節目製作人，因為心臟衰竭而等著換心，在媒體上呼籲希望有人捐心給他，殊不知他就是因為相信西醫學，相信西藥，才會有今天面臨心臟衰竭的後果，但是他仍然執迷不悟的相信西醫幫他換心 ，可以治好他，真是糊塗啊，他在等有人捐心臟給他之前，卻寧死也不要看中醫，真是可悲，希望大家可以從他身上學到教訓，不要再相信西醫可以治療心臟病了，我可以預測此人必然會死於西醫手上。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-dfve8ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-dfve8ls","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t一種無法將心臟病治好的醫學，是無法治療癌症的。"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-jzq1bq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-jzq1bq2","updated":"20240522095919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"\t菲菲很優秀啊，老師非常高興妳學有所成。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522095859-aggvyjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095859-aggvyjp","updated":"20240522095859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海厦謹記於2009年11月11日"}]},{"ID":"20240522095901-c83y9up","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522095901-c83y9up"}},{"ID":"20240522095902-n126fgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522095902-n126fgh"}}]}